2. BBQ Chicken Pizza

Smoky & Savory

Ingredients:

    Pizza dough

    1/3 cup BBQ sauce

    1 cup cooked chicken, shredded

    very spicy pepper

    1/2 red onion, thinly sliced

    1 cup mozzarella cheese

    Chopped coriander (optional)

Instructions:

    Preheat oven to 220°C (430°F).

    Spread BBQ sauce on dough.

    Add chicken, onion, and cheese.

    Bake 12–15 minutes.

    Sprinkle coriander before serving.



